  "description": "The Litening AERO C:68X SLX's blend of low weight, long-haul comfort and wind tunnel-tested, UCI-compliant aerodynamics gives you a head start that is sure to make a tangible difference to your results. A Newmen Allround 49/54 Vonoa wheelset wrapped with 28mm Continental Grand Prix 5000 S-TR tyres combines aerodynamic design with light weight. Meanwhile Sram's Red 2x12 wireless AXS groupset puts a wide gear range and awesome stopping power at your fingertips – and, with its integrated power meter, you're on top of your performance at all times. Put it all together with a frame and fork set-up that's 150g lighter and up to 6 watts more efficient than before, and it's a great recipe for helping you break free of the bunch.",
